<title>FRANCE: Reuters 4th ex-Paris/Americas air cargo report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 4th ex-Paris/Americas air cargo report.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are current average ex-Paris French franc air cargo rates per kilo for a 100kg shipment with volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>		    July 8    May 28</p>
<p>			N.AMERICA</p>
<p>  PAR-JFK	 5.65	5.60</p>
<p>  PAR-CHI	 6.15	6.10</p>
<p>  PAR-LA	  6.80	6.75</p>
<p>  PAR-YMX	 6.75	6.75</p>
<p>LATAM</p>
<p>  PAR-MEX	11.90     11.90</p>
<p>  PAR-SAO	18.00     18.00</p>
<p>The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller cargo agents based at the Paris airports.</p>
<p>All prices are quoted in French francs.</p>
<p>The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
</text>
